<?php

namespace Database\Seeders;

use Illuminate\Database\Seeder;
use App\Models\Faq;

class FaqSeeder extends Seeder
{
    public function run()
    {
        $faqs = json_decode('[{"question": "How to Register or sign up for your ZigZapGo account?", "answer": "<p><strong>Registering Your Business with ZigZapGo</strong></p>\n\n<p>To initiate the registration process for your business with ZigZapGo, kindly follow these steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Access the Signup Form:</strong> Visit our homepage or use the following link: <a href=\"https://zigzapgo.com/register\" target=\"_new\">https://zigzapgo.com/register</a>. Alternatively, click on the \"Register\" option available on the homepage.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Email Verification and Credentials:</strong> Upon completing the signup request, you will promptly receive an email on the provided email address. To proceed, kindly verify your email by clicking the designated Green Button within the email. This email will contain your assigned username and a secure password for your account.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Login with Provided Credentials:</strong> Use the provided username and password from the email to log in to your account. Additionally, ensure that the password is both unique and secure to enhance the protection of your account.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Provide Company Details:</strong> Once logged in with the provided credentials, you will be seamlessly redirected to a new page. Here, furnish essential details about your company. Ensure accuracy and completeness in providing information such as your company name, industry, business address, and contact details.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Dashboard Access:</strong> With your login credentials established, access your ZigZapGo dashboard. This centralized hub empowers you to manage diverse aspects of your business, from customer relationships to sales data and beyond.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Explore Platform Features:</strong> Take the time to familiarize yourself with the array of features and tools available within ZigZapGo. Explore functionalities catering to customer management, sales tracking, reporting, and other facets pertinent to your business operations.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Customize Settings:</strong> Tailor the CRM settings to align seamlessly with your business processes. This may involve configuring user permissions, establishing pipelines, and customizing fields to capture industry-specific data.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Training and Support:</strong> Avail yourself of any training resources or customer support services provided by ZigZapGo. A comprehensive understanding of the platform enhances your ability to leverage its capabilities effectively.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Congratulations! You have successfully completed the registration process with ZigZapGo and are now poised to optimize your business management. Should you encounter any challenges or have additional inquiries, our dedicated support team is at your disposal for assistance.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 1}, {"question": "How to Add New User in zigzapgo.com?", "answer": "<p><strong>Adding a User in ZigZapGo</strong></p>\n\n<p>To seamlessly add a new user to your ZigZapGo account, follow these steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Navigate to User List:</strong> Start by clicking on the \"User\" tab in the left menu. Once selected, proceed to click on \"User List.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Access the Add New User Feature:</strong> In the upper right corner, you will find a \"+ Add New\" button. Click on this button to initiate the user creation process.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Complete Required Fields:</strong> A new window will appear. Fill in the necessary fields with accurate information for the new user. Ensure that all mandatory fields are completed, and then click the \"Save\" button.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Email Confirmation:</strong> Following the successful addition of the new user, an email confirmation will be sent to the provided email address. Look for an email with the subject \"New Account Create\" from care@zigzapgo.com. This email will also contain your assigned username and password. Utilize these credentials for login after email verification.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Check Your Inbox:</strong> If the confirmation email is not immediately visible, please wait for up to 5 minutes. Check your primary inbox, promotion folder, or spam folder. In case the email is not received within 15 minutes, contact our customer care at +91-7876557373 for further assistance.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>By following these steps, you\'ll efficiently add a new user to your ZigZapGo account, enhancing collaboration and user management within the platform. If you encounter any challenges or have additional inquiries, feel free to reach out to our dedicated customer care team for prompt assistance.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 2}, {"question": "How to edit an user, delete user or activate/Deactivate user?", "answer": "<p><strong>Editing, Deleting, and Disable/Enable Users in ZigZapGo</strong></p>\n\n<p><em>Editing a User:</em></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Navigate to the \"Users\" menu in the left menu bar.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Click on \"User List.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>The user list will appear on the right side of the main menu.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Identify the user you wish to edit/delete/disable/enable.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Scroll down to the right side of the list.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>To edit, click on the yellow Pen icon.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Modify the necessary fields as per your requirements.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Press the \"Save\" button to apply the changes.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><em>Deleting a User:</em></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Follow the same steps to access the \"Users\" menu and click on \"User List.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Identify the user you want to delete.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Scroll down to the right side of the list.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>To delete, click on the red Pen icon.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Upon clicking the red delete button, you will be prompted to either confirm or cancel your decision.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Press \"Yes, Delete It!\" to delete the user or \"Cancel\" to abort the deletion.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><em>Disabling/Enabling a User:</em></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Similarly, go to the \"Users\" menu and click on \"User List.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Identify the user you want to disable or enable.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Scroll down to the right side of the list.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>To disable, click on the red X icon.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Upon clicking the red X button, the user will be disabled. They won\'t be visible in emails or API User section filters, and no queries will be auto-assigned to them. The user will not be able to log in.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>To enable, click on the green checkmark. The user will be enabled and visible in all lists.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>By following these steps, you can efficiently manage user profiles within ZigZapGo. If you encounter any challenges or have additional inquiries, feel free to reach out to our dedicated customer support team for assistance.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 3}, {"question": "I am not able to login my ZigZapGo account and it is redirecting back to login page?", "answer": "<p><strong>Fixing Login Issue on ZigZapGo Account: Redirecting Back to Login Page</strong></p>\n\n<p>Encountering difficulties logging into your ZigZapGo account, where it continuously redirects you back to the login page.Time zone discrepancies is a common concern for users who have recently installed a new Windows operating system on their laptop or desktop. To address this issue effectively, follow these simple steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Access Date/Time Settings:</strong> Right-click on the clock and calendar displayed on the taskbar.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Navigate to Date/Time Settings:</strong> Select \"Adjust date/time\" from the context menu.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Choose the Correct Time Zone:</strong> Within the Date &amp; time settings, locate the \"Time Zone\" section and set it to \"(UTC+5:30) Chennai, Kolkata, Mumbai, New Delhi.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Adjust Time Setting:</strong> On the top of the page, choose between \"Set time automatically\" or \"Set the date and time manually,\" depending on your preference.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Synchronize Time:</strong> If you are connected to the internet, consider clicking the \"Sync Now\" button to ensure that the time is accurately synchronized.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>By following these steps, you should be able to resolve the time zone issue on your newly installed Windows system. This adjustment ensures that your device\'s time settings align correctly with your geographical location. If the issue persists or if you have any further concerns, feel free to seek additional assistance from your IT support or Windows service resources.</p>\n\n<p>Give this solution a try, and it should help address the time zone discrepancy on your Windows device.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 4}, {"question": "How to Add/edit New Lead Source?", "answer": "<p><strong>Adding Leads: Step-by-Step Guide</strong></p>\n\n<p>To efficiently add leads to your system, adhere to the following steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Create Lead Source Label:</strong> Initiate the process by establishing lead source labels to categorize and identify the origins of your leads. Navigate to \"Left Main Menu\" &gt;&gt; \"Company Setting\" &gt;&gt; \"Lead Source.\" Click on the \"+Add New\" button located at the right top corner.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Name the Source:</strong> In the input box, assign a clear and descriptive name to the lead source. Afterward, click \"Submit\" to confirm.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Generate Multiple Lead Sources:</strong> Create as many lead sources as needed to comprehensively capture the diverse origins of your leads.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Explore Auto Fetch Functionality:</strong> If you wish to automate the process of fetching leads, refer to our detailed article on \"How to Auto Fetch Leads?\" for step-by-step instructions and insights.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>By diligently following these steps, you can systematically organize and manage the sources of your leads within the system. This structured approach enhances lead tracking and analysis. For any further assistance or inquiries, refer to our support resources, ensuring a seamless experience in utilizing lead management features.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 5}, {"question": "How to Add/Edit New Lead Status?", "answer": "<p><strong>Adding Leads: Step-by-Step Guide</strong></p>\n\n<p>To seamlessly add leads to your system, carefully follow these steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Create Lead Status:</strong> Begin by establishing lead statuses to categorize and track the progress of your leads. Navigate to \"Left Main Menu\" &gt;&gt; \"Company Setting\" &gt;&gt; \"Lead Status.\" Click on the \"+Add New\" button at the right top corner.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Name the Status:</strong> In the input box, assign a distinctive name to the lead status.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Choose Color Code:</strong> Adjust the color code by clicking and dragging the grey ball to your preferred color. Ensure it differs from colors used for other lead statuses. Click \"Submit\" to confirm.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Create Multiple Lead Statuses:</strong> Generate as many lead status&nbsp;as necessary to align with your business processes.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Edit Lead Status:</strong> To modify the name or color of a lead status, scroll to the right of the status and click on the \"Yellow color pen box\" for editing.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Edit Name or Color:</strong> Adjust the name or color as needed, then click \"Submit\" to save your changes.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>By diligently following these steps, you can efficiently set up lead statuses tailored to your business requirements. This organization ensures a systematic approach to lead management. If you encounter any challenges or require further assistance, do not hesitate to reach out to our support team for prompt help and guidance.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 6}, {"question": "How to Auto Fetch Leads and auto assign to specified Team Members?", "answer": "<p><strong>Integrating Lead Sources with ZigZapGo for Seamless Lead Management</strong></p>\n\n<p>Integrating your lead sources with ZigZapGo is a strategic move to streamline your workflow. There are two primary methods to achieve this integration:</p>\n\n<p><strong>1. Leads Via API (Application Programming Interface):</strong></p>\n\n<p>a. Navigate to ZigZapGo Menu &gt;&gt; Company Settings &gt;&gt; Lead APIs. Click on \"+Add New\" at the right top corner.</p>\n\n<p>b. Select the desired API from the list. If your specific lead source API is not listed, reach out to your leads service provider for the API or webhook service documentation.</p>\n\n<p>c. If your lead source is already on the list, click \"Enable\" below the lead source.</p>\n\n<p>d. After enabling, click again to confirm. Fill in all the required fields.</p>\n\n<p>e. Choose between assigning leads to a single user or multiple users. For multiple users, set \"Round Robin Lead Allocation\" to Yes.</p>\n\n<p>f. To assign leads, click on the user\'s name (email id) for a single user or select multiple users by holding the Control button and left-clicking with the mouse.</p>\n\n<p>g. If you wish to manually assign leads, select \"Assign by Own Choice\" from the list.</p>\n\n<p>h. Enable round-robin shifts if you want to provide users with time-wise access to the portal.</p>\n\n<p>i. Select the preferred lead status, and it\'s recommended to choose \"New.\"</p>\n\n<p>j. If you wish to trash specific types of leads, choose the lead type from the list.</p>\n\n<p>k. For leads that you want to stop auto-assigning, select \"Auto Unassigned\" and choose the lead type.Proceed to the dashboard and click on \"Unassigned Leads.\"A list with a blank \"Assigned to\" value will appear.From this list, manually assign leads to specific users by selecting the desired user.</p>\n\n<p>l. Click \"Save\" to confirm your selections.</p>\n\n<p>m. If you are not utilizing a lead source or have not renewed your subscription, it\'s advisable to disable the API to eliminate API errors.</p>\n\n<p>n. Check after 15 minutes of saving for the Last Check and Last Lead timestamps. If leads are not fetched, review the error and attempt to fix. For further assistance, contact our support team.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>2. Fetching Leads from Your Email ID:</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Before going to this process you should required the following steps to be completed.</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Read <a href=\"https://zigzapgo.com/app/medsyn-lab-biotech/faqs#collapse10\" target=\"_self\">Required a New Email id.</a></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Read <a href=\"https://zigzapgo.com/app/medsyn-lab-biotech/faqs#collapse8\" target=\"_self\">Add a forwarding address in gmail.</a></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Read <a href=\"https://zigzapgo.com/app/medsyn-lab-biotech/faqs#collapse9\" target=\"_self\">Create Filters in gmail.</a></strong></p>\n\n<p>To retrieve leads from your email ID, follow these steps:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Email Configuration:</strong></p>\n\n<p>a. Set up your email account within ZigZapGo by navigating to the relevant settings. (Main Menu &gt; Company Settings &gt; Email Inboxes)</p>\n\n<p>b. Click on the \"+Add New\" green button at the top right.</p>\n\n<p>c. Input the email ID created specifically for fetching leads and click Submit.</p>\n\n<p>d. The added email ID will appear in the list below.</p>\n\n<p>e. Click on the blue-colored switch button; it will open a window to select the email type, either \"Gmail\" or \"Other.\"</p>\n\n<p>f. Choose the type of email integration you want.</p>\n\n<p>g. Enter or choose the email ID from the list.</p>\n\n<p>h. If it is Gmail, a window may show \"zigzapgo.com is not safe.\" Click on \"Advance\" and choose \"go to zigzapgo.com unsafe,\" then grant the necessary permissions asked by ZigZapGo and click Submit.</p>\n\n<p>i. Click on the specific email ID you added to view and manage the leads fetched from this email source. Navigate to the right side and click on the yellow-colored filter icon.</p>\n\n<p>j. Click on the \"+Add New\" green button at the top right. k. Input the values required to create a filter: Lead Source Name, Select Lead source, Leave \"from\" blank, Leave subject blank. If the from email ID is the same and subject line is different, and you want to assign one subject line lead to one user and the second type subject line leads to another.</p>\n\n<p>l. Repeat steps j and k for additional filters.</p>\n\n<p>m. Select the template from the list, and if it is not available, contact our customer support team.</p>\n\n<p>n. Choose the lead status from the list that you want to assign to the newly added lead. We suggest choosing \"New.\"</p>\n\n<p>o. To assign the lead to a single user, keep the Round Robin Lead allocation to No, and select a user from the list. If you wish to allocate leads to multiple users, hold the control button and select users from the list using the left-click of the mouse.</p>\n\n<p>p. Choose status Active.</p>\n\n<p>q. \"Has Word\" is used if the email body contains a specific word for which you want to assign a specific user. To use this, you also have to leave the subject line field blank.</p>\n\n<p>r. Click Submit.</p>\n\n<p>Repeat steps j to r to add multiple lead sources.</p>\n\n<p>By integrating your lead sources using these steps, you enhance the efficiency of lead management within ZigZapGo. If you encounter any challenges or require assistance, our support team is available to help ensure a seamless integration experience.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 7}, {"question": "How to add a forwarding email address in Gmail?", "answer": "<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Open Gmail:</strong> Open your Gmail account by going to <a href=\"https://mail.google.com/\" target=\"_new\">https://mail.google.com/</a> and log in with your credentials.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Access Settings:</strong> In the top right corner, click on the gear icon (\u2699\ufe0f) and select \"See all settings.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Go to Forwarding and POP/IMAP:</strong> Navigate to the \"Forwarding and POP/IMAP\" tab within the Settings menu.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Add a Forwarding Address:</strong> Under the \"Forwarding\" section, click on \"Add a forwarding address.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Enter the Email Address:</strong> A pop-up window will appear. Enter the email address to which you want to forward your Gmail messages and click \"Next.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Confirmation:</strong> Gmail will ask for confirmation. Click \"Proceed\" to confirm that you want to forward your emails to the specified address.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Verify Forwarding Address:</strong> Gmail will send a verification email to the forwarding address. Open the forwarding email account, find the verification email from Gmail, and click on the provided link to verify.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Confirm Forwarding:</strong> Go back to Gmail settings, refresh the page, and check the \"Forward a copy of incoming mail to\" option. Select your forwarding email address from the drop-down menu.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Choose Forwarding Options:</strong> Choose your preferred forwarding options, such as whether to keep a copy of forwarded emails in your Gmail inbox or to mark them as read.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Save Changes:</strong> Scroll down and click \"Save Changes\" at the bottom of the settings page.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Now, your Gmail messages will be forwarded to the specified email address. Make sure to periodically check the forwarding settings to ensure they meet your preferences.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 8}, {"question": "How to Create a Filter in Gmail?", "answer": "<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Open Gmail:</strong> Open your Gmail account by navigating to <a href=\"https://mail.google.com/\" target=\"_new\">https://mail.google.com/</a> and log in with your credentials.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Access Settings:</strong> In the top right corner, click on the gear icon (\u2699\ufe0f) and select \"See all settings.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Go to Filters and Blocked Addresses:</strong> Navigate to the \"Filters and Blocked Addresses\" tab within the Settings menu.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Create a New Filter:</strong> Scroll down to find the \"Create a new filter\" link and click on it.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Define Filter Criteria:</strong> In the filter creation window, specify the criteria for your filter. Most likely, you have to choose parameters such as sender\'s email address, subject, keywords, etc. Subject or from email ID are commonly used criteria, especially for queries received from lead sources.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Click \"Create filter\":</strong> After defining the filter criteria, click on the \"Create filter\" button.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Choose Filter Actions:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Forward it to: [Select the email ID added for forwarding]</li>\n\t\t<li>Never send it to Spam</li>\n\t\t<li>Always mark it as important</li>\n\t\t<li>Categorize as \"Primary\"</li>\n\t\t<li>Also apply filter to 0 matching conversations</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Save Filter:</strong> Click on the \"Create filter\" button to save your filter settings.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Your filter is now configured to forward, mark as important, categorize, and apply other specified actions to emails that match the defined criteria. Gmail will automatically process incoming emails based on your filter settings. If needed, you can always modify or delete filters by revisiting the \"Filters and Blocked Addresses\" section in Gmail settings.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 9}, {"question": "Why we create a seperate email id for Leads Auto Fetch?", "answer": "<h2>Creating a new email ID specifically for fetching leads offers several advantages:</h2>\n\n<p>\"To ensure the seamless and automated retrieval of emails for CRM integration, it is imperative to employ a dedicated, unread email address. This strategic choice is driven by the necessity to prevent interference from external factors, such as accidental reads or deletions, that could compromise the integrity of the lead data. The utilization of a distinct and dedicated email account minimizes the risk of emails being marked as read prematurely, thereby avoiding potential data loss. This meticulous approach enhances the reliability and effectiveness of the lead-fetching process, ensuring that each lead is captured and processed accurately within the CRM system.\"</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Organized Communication:</strong> By dedicating an email ID solely for lead fetching, you keep your communication channels organized. It helps to separate business-related leads from personal or other professional emails.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Focused Filtering:</strong> A designated email ID allows you to set up filters and rules more effectively. You can tailor the filtering criteria to match the specific requirements of lead-related emails, ensuring that relevant messages are easily identified.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Minimized Clutter:</strong> Lead-related emails, especially those fetched from various sources, can sometimes inundate your inbox. Having a separate email ID helps in minimizing clutter in your primary inbox, making it easier to manage and respond to leads.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Enhanced Security:</strong> Using a unique email ID for lead fetching adds an extra layer of security. It reduces the risk of exposing personal or critical communication to potential security threats associated with lead-related queries.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Efficient Tracking:</strong> With a distinct email ID, you can track leads more efficiently. It simplifies the process of monitoring responses, interactions, and the overall lead management process without interference from unrelated emails.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Clear Attribution:</strong> When leads are fetched into your CRM or business system using a specific email ID, it provides clear attribution. This attribution is valuable for tracking the source of leads and understanding the effectiveness of different lead-generation channels.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Easy Configuration:</strong> Setting up email integration and configuration within CRM or other tools becomes straightforward when using a dedicated email ID. It ensures that the integration is streamlined and specific to the purpose of lead management.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>In summary, creating a new email ID for fetching leads is a strategic approach to maintain organization, efficiency, and security in your lead management processes. It enables you to optimize filtering, tracking, and attribution, ultimately contributing to a more effective and streamlined lead management workflow.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 10}, {"question": "How to add New Lead Manually?", "answer": "<p>To manually add a new lead, there are two streamlined options at your disposal:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Utilize the Header Icon:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Navigate to the header and locate the \"+\" icon.</li>\n\t\t<li>Click on the \"+\" icon to reveal a dropdown menu titled \"New Lead.\"</li>\n\t\t<li>Select \"New Lead\" to access a comprehensive form.</li>\n\t\t<li>Populate the necessary fields, and optionally include additional details.</li>\n\t\t<li>Upon completion, click the submit button.</li>\n\t\t<li>Witness the seamless addition of the lead, now visible on the Lead List page.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Access through Main Menu:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Head to the Main Menu and navigate to Leads.</li>\n\t\t<li>Choose \"Lead List\" from the options provided.</li>\n\t\t<li>On the right top corner, spot the \"+ Add New\" button.</li>\n\t\t<li>Click on \"+ Add New\" to open a user-friendly form.</li>\n\t\t<li>Input the relevant details into the form.</li>\n\t\t<li>Conclude the process by clicking the submit button.</li>\n\t\t<li>To locate the added lead swiftly, employ the search box on the Lead List page, using the lead\'s phone number or email address.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>By following these professional steps, you ensure a systematic and efficient addition of new leads to your database.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 11}, {"question": "How can i upload excel sheet of my old data in zigzapgo.com", "answer": "<p>Certainly! If you want to upload bulk leads into ZigZapGo, here are the steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Convert Excel to CSV:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Open the Excel file containing your leads.</li>\n\t\t<li>Organize data with each column representing a specific attribute (e.g., name, email, phone number).</li>\n\t\t<li>Go to \"File\" in the Excel menu.</li>\n\t\t<li>Choose \"Save As\" and select the destination.</li>\n\t\t<li>In \"Save as type,\" choose \"CSV (Comma delimited) (*.csv).\"</li>\n\t\t<li>Click \"Save.\"</li>\n\t\t<li>If warned about compatibility, click \"OK\" or \"Yes.\"</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Add Three Columns:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\"Assigned to\": Email of the user for lead assignment. Leave blank for manual assignment.</li>\n\t\t<li>\"Lead Status\": Copy or paste from the Lead Status List (case-sensitive).</li>\n\t\t<li>\"Lead Source\": Copy from the Lead Source List or add a new source.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Mobile Number Formatting:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Ensure 10-digit numbers without spaces, plus signs, or special characters.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Bulk Upload in ZigZapGo:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Navigate to Main Menu &gt; Leads &gt; Lead List &gt; Click on +Bulk Upload.</li>\n\t\t<li>Click + upload, select the CSV file, and upload.</li>\n\t\t<li>After upload, go back to Bulk Upload page.</li>\n\t\t<li>On the right side, click \"Map Field.\"</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Map Fields:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Map your CSV fields to CRM system fields.</li>\n\t\t<li>If unsure about a field, leave it blank.</li>\n\t\t<li>Click submit to start parsing data.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Check Status and Verify in Lead List:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Visit the Bulk Upload page later to check the status.</li>\n\t\t<li>Look for the \"processed\" message in the Status column on the Bulk Upload page.</li>\n\t\t<li>Once the upload is processed, return to the lead list page.</li>\n\t\t<li>Verify that your data sheet has been successfully uploaded in ZigZapGo.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ol>", "is_active": 1, "order": 12}, {"question": "How to add new Input box in Lead form or on lead detail page?", "answer": "<p>To incorporate an additional input box in the lead form or position it on the left side of the lead detail page, follow these steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Navigate to Company Settings and select \"Custom Fields.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Click on \"+ Add New\" to create a new custom field.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Choose the desired type of input box from the following options:</p>\n\n\t<p>a. Single Line: Enables the inclusion of text, numbers, or special characters.</p>\n\n\t<p>b. Drop-down: Allows the addition of multiple values, with the selection limited to a single value. Values can include text, numbers, or special characters.</p>\n\n\t<p>c. Multiselect: Permits the addition of multiple values, with the flexibility to select multiple values simultaneously by holding the control key and clicking on the desired options.</p>\n\n\t<p>d. Multiple Line Text Box: Provides a space for entering multiple lines of text.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>If you wish to display the new field in the quick edit section on the lead detail page, select \"Display in Quick Edit\" and set it to \"Yes.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Optionally, if you want to make this field mandatory, select \"Required\" and set it to \"Yes.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Upon completion, this newly created field will be incorporated into the lead list page columns and will be available for use in filters.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 13}, {"question": "How to show New Added fields or custome fields in Lead List Page?", "answer": "<p>To reorganize the columns on your lead list page, follow these steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Navigate to the Main Menu and select \"Leads,\" then click on \"Lead List.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>On the right side of the lead list page, locate the blue \"Custom Column\" button and click on it.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>A popup window will appear, presenting active columns on the right and available columns on the left.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>To add a field from the available columns, click on it, hold down the left mouse button, drag it to the right side, and drop it above or below the desired column.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Once you\'ve arranged the fields to your preference, click \"Submit.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>The lead list page will now display the newly arranged columns. However, to retain this configuration for future use, you must save the view.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Click on the settings button on the left side of the page.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>In the popup screen, you\'ll find \"All Dashboards\" on the left and options on the right. Click on \"Options\" in the dropdown menu.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Select \"Clone\" from the options. A new popup will appear, allowing you to name your view and choose the options visible on the screen.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>If you want to set this view as the default, select \"Set a Default.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>If you wish to save this view for future use and have it displayed in a specific location, click \"Show in My Reports.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>After clicking \"Submit,\" refresh the page by selecting it and pressing the F5 key on the dashboard.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>A new menu named \"My Reports\" will appear after \"Reports\" in the Main Menu if you selected the option to show in My Reports.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>If you prefer not to show it in My Reports, leave this option unselected, and it will be available across all dashboards for future selection.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Ensure to follow these steps meticulously to customize and save your lead list page view according to your preferences.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 14}, {"question": "How to Apply filters in List Views or export excel of List ?", "answer": "<p>To apply filters to any list, follow these steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Navigate to the list page.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Click on \"+Add Filter\" located just below the current filters.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>A pop-up screen will appear; choose the value you wish to filter.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Select the specific value or date for the chosen filter criteria.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Click on \"Apply Filter\" to implement the selected filter.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>If you wish to export the filtered list to Excel, follow these additional steps:</p>\n\n<ol start=\"6\">\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Click on the settings button.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Select \"Options\" and click on \"Export.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>After a brief period, you will receive an email containing the exported data. The email will be sent to the email address associated with your login credentials.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Please note that the time required to receive the email depends on the number of data rows being exported.</p>\n\n<p>Ensure to follow these steps diligently for effective filtering and exporting of data from the list.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 15}, {"question": "How to Add Receipt/Activate in Crm?", "answer": "<p>To incorporate a payment receipt system into your CRM, begin by activating the feature through the following steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Access the main menu and navigate to \"Company Settings.\"</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Click on \"Companies\" to access the company settings.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Within the Companies section, select \"+Add New\" to input the required details. Ensure to provide the necessary values, including those in the invoice settings.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Once all details are entered, click \"Submit\" to save the configuration.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Upon submission, you will observe the newly added company name in the list of companies. Scroll to the right, where you will find two green buttons.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Click on the first button to add banks associated with the company.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Complete the bank setup process.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>With these configurations in place, you will now have the capability to add new receipts on the lead list page.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>By following these steps diligently, you\'ll successfully activate and integrate the payment receipt system into your CRM, enhancing its functionality for efficient financial management.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 16}, {"question": "How to Add your Mobile No for Whatsapp Business Api Usage?", "answer": "<p>To add your phone number to Facebook Business Manager, follow these steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Access Facebook Business Manager:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Go to the Facebook Business Manager website: business.facebook.com.</li>\n\t\t<li>Log in with your Facebook account credentials.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Navigate to Business Settings:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>In the top right corner, click on the gear icon to open the Business Manager menu.</li>\n\t\t<li>Select \"Business Settings\" from the drop-down menu.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Choose Your Business:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>In the left-hand menu, select the business for which you want to add a phone number.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Go to Business Info:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>In the Business Settings menu, click on \"Business Info\" in the left-hand column.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Add or Edit Contact Details:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Scroll down to the \"Contact Info\" section.</li>\n\t\t<li>You will find fields for various contact information, including phone number.</li>\n\t\t<li>Click on the \"Edit\" button to add or update your phone number.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Add Your Phone Number:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>In the \"Contact Info\" section, you can add your phone number in the provided field.</li>\n\t\t<li>Make sure to include the country code and area code if applicable.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Save Changes:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>After adding your phone number, click the \"Save Changes\" button at the bottom of the page.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Verify Your Phone Number (if prompted):</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Facebook may ask you to verify your phone number by sending a verification code via SMS. If prompted, enter the code to confirm your phone number.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ol>", "is_active": 1, "order": 17}, {"question": "How to create facebook business manager account?", "answer": "<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Go to Facebook Business Manager:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Open a web browser and go to the Facebook Business Manager website: business.facebook.com.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Log In or Sign Up:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>If you already have a personal Facebook account, log in using your credentials (email/phone and password).</li>\n\t\t<li>If you don\'t have a personal Facebook account, you will need to sign up first by providing the necessary information.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Create a Business Manager Account:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Once logged in, click on the \"Create Account\" button on the Business Manager homepage.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Provide Business Details:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Fill in the required information to create your Business Manager account. This includes your business name, your name, and your business email.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Add Your Business Page:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>If you already have a Facebook Page for your business, you can add it to your Business Manager during the setup process. If not, you can create a new Page.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Enter Account Details:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Complete the required fields for your business profile, including the country/region, address, industry, and business size.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Agree to Terms:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Review Facebook\'s terms and policies. If you agree, check the box to confirm your acceptance.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Submit and Confirm:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Click the \"Submit\" button to create your Business Manager account.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ol>", "is_active": 1, "order": 18}, {"question": "How to add phone number to business manager account?", "answer": "<ol start=\"5\">\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Access WhatsApp Manager</strong>: Within Business Settings, click on \"WhatsApp Manager\" in the left-hand column.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Navigate to Phone Numbers</strong>: In the WhatsApp Manager, locate and click on \"Accounts Tools\" and then select \"Phone Numbers\" from the dropdown menu.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Add a Phone Number</strong>: Once you\'re on the Phone Numbers page, click on the \"Add Phone Number\" button located on the right side of the screen.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Fill in Required Details</strong>: Complete the form with all the necessary details for adding a new phone number associated with WhatsApp Business. This typically includes providing the phone number and verifying ownership through a confirmation code.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><strong>Share Details</strong>: After adding the phone number, share the details with the relevant team or individual who will assist you further. This could involve sharing the phone number itself or providing access to the WhatsApp Business account.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>", "is_active": 1, "order": 19}, {"question": "How to Enable/Disable two-factor authentication for your WhatsApp Business phone numbers in facebook business manager?", "answer": "<ol>\n\t<li>Log in to your Facebook Business Manager account.</li>\n\t<li>Click on the menu icon represented by three parallel lines located at the top left corner of the page.</li>\n\t<li>Select \"WhatsApp Manager\" from the list of options.</li>\n\t<li>Navigate to \"Account Tools\" in the left-hand menu.</li>\n\t<li>Choose \"Phone Numbers\" from the available options.</li>\n\t<li>Identify the specific phone number you wish to manage and click on it.</li>\n\t<li>In the settings menu that appears, locate the \"Two Factor Authentication\" option.</li>\n\t<li>If 2FA is enabled, you can easily turn it off by toggling the switch provided.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>By following these steps, you can effectively manage the two-factor authentication settings for your WhatsApp Business phone numbers within Facebook Business Manager.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 20}, {"question": "How to edit Display Name, Profile Photo, Business Description and Address of your whatsapp business phone number?", "answer": "<ol>\n\t<li>Log in to your Facebook Business Manager account.</li>\n\t<li>Click on the menu icon represented by three parallel lines located at the top left corner of the page.</li>\n\t<li>Select \"WhatsApp Manager\" from the list of options.</li>\n\t<li>Navigate to \"Account Tools\" in the left-hand menu.</li>\n\t<li>Choose \"Phone Numbers\" from the available options.</li>\n\t<li>Identify the specific phone number you wish to manage and click on it.</li>\n\t<li>In the settings menu, locate the \"Profile\" option.</li>\n\t<li>Edit the fields as needed to display the information you want on your business profile.</li>\n</ol>", "is_active": 1, "order": 21}, {"question": "How to add payment receipt or sale receipt in crm for sales collection report?", "answer": "<p>To begin using the Payment and Receipts functionality in ZigZapGo, follow these initial steps:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Create a Company Profile:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Log in to the CRM dashboard and find the company settings in the left main menu.</li>\n\t<li>Look for the option named \"Companies.\"</li>\n\t<li>Click on the \"+Add New\" button located in the top right corner.</li>\n\t<li>Fill in essential details such as the company name, address, contact information, tax details, and if you want to create invoices, fill the required fields of invoice settings.</li>\n\t<li>Save the company profile once all required fields are completed.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><strong>Add Bank Details:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>After setting up the company profile, navigate to the right side where you\'ll find two green buttons. Hover your mouse over the first one, which will show \"Manage Banks.\"</li>\n\t<li>Click on the \"+Add New\" button on the top right corner.</li>\n\t<li>Input the required bank information, including the bank name, account number, IFSC number, and any other relevant details.</li>\n\t<li>Double-check the accuracy of the entered information to ensure seamless transactions.</li>\n\t<li>Save the bank details to finalize the setup. Repeat the above steps to add multiple banks if necessary.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><strong>Adding Receipts:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>After completing the steps, navigate to the lead to which you want to add a receipt.</li>\n\t<li>Click on the \"Create Receipt\" button and fill in all required fields.</li>\n\t<li>After that, click on \"Submit\" to save the receipt. Your receipt will be shown in the activity history, and a new button of \"Check Ledger\" will be activated.</li>\n\t<li>Clicking on the ledger will allow you to see all payment entries of that lead.</li>\n\t<li>The added receipt will also be included in the sales report located in the left main menu under the reports section, to access the total collection by all members or any selected member.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Following these steps will enable you to effectively manage payments and receipts within the ZigZapGo platform.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 22}, {"question": "How to Manage Division or multiple companies for sale receipts and working Location assignment?", "answer": "<p>Before your get started with division you need to Create a Company first and if you already created a company then To begin using the Payment and Receipts functionality in ZigZapGo, follow these initial steps:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Create a Company Profile:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Log in to the CRM dashboard and find the company settings in the left main menu.</li>\n\t<li>Look for the option named \"Companies.\"</li>\n\t<li>Click on the \"+Add New\" button located in the top right corner.</li>\n\t<li>Fill in essential details such as the company name, address, contact information, tax details, and if you want to create invoices, fill the required fields of invoice settings.</li>\n\t<li>Save the company profile once all required fields are completed.<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><strong>Add Bank Details:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>After setting up the company profile, navigate to the right side where you\'ll find two green buttons. Hover your mouse over the first one, which will show \"Manage Banks.\"</li>\n\t<li>Click on the \"+Add New\" button on the top right corner.</li>\n\t<li>Input the required bank information, including the bank name, account number, IFSC number, and any other relevant details.</li>\n\t<li>Double-check the accuracy of the entered information to ensure seamless transactions.</li>\n\t<li>Save the bank details to finalize the setup. Repeat the above steps to add multiple banks if necessary.</li>\n</ol>", "is_active": 1, "order": 23}, {"question": "How to Add a division or Create a division for receipts and working locations?", "answer": "<p>To create a division in ZigZapGo, first you need to create a company by following the below mentioned steps:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Create a Company Profile:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Log in to the CRM dashboard and find the company settings in the left main menu.</li>\n\t<li>Look for the option named \"Companies.\"</li>\n\t<li>Click on the \"+Add New\" button located in the top right corner.</li>\n\t<li>Fill in essential details such as the company name, address, contact information, tax details, and if you want to create invoices, fill the required fields of invoice settings.</li>\n\t<li>Save the company profile once all required fields are completed.<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><strong>Create a Division:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Go back to the companies page.</li>\n\t<li>Select the company where you want to add divisions.</li>\n\t<li>Navigate to the right side of the company table and click on the second green button named \"Manage Divisions.\"</li>\n\t<li>Click on the \"+Add New\" button to create a new division.</li>\n\t<li>Input the name of the division and click on \"enable\" in the next selection box.</li>\n\t<li>If you want to automatically map the lead location on a map, then tick the checkbox labeled \"Auto map locations.\"</li>\n\t<li>If you want to restrict one location for one lead in one division, then tick on \"limit members\" and input the number of allowed members in that location.</li>\n\t<li>Once you\'re done, click \"Submit.\"</li>\n\t<li>Repeat these steps to add as many divisions as needed.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>If you want to activate the Receipt feature, follow the steps of adding a bank mentioned below.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Add Bank Details:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>After setting up the company profile, navigate to the right side where you\'ll find two green buttons. Hover your mouse over the first one, which will show \"Manage Banks.\"</li>\n\t<li>Click on the \"+Add New\" button on the top right corner.</li>\n\t<li>Input the required bank information, including the bank name, account number, IFSC number, and any other relevant details.</li>\n\t<li>Double-check the accuracy of the entered information to ensure seamless transactions.</li>\n\t<li>Save the bank details to finalize the setup. Repeat the above steps to add multiple banks if necessary.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><strong>Adding Receipts:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>After completing the steps, navigate to the lead to which you want to add a receipt.</li>\n\t<li>Click on the \"Create Receipt\" button and fill in all required fields.</li>\n\t<li>After that, click on \"Submit\" to save the receipt. Your receipt will be shown in the activity history, and a new button of \"Check Ledger\" will be activated.</li>\n\t<li>Clicking on the ledger will allow you to see all payment entries of that lead.</li>\n\t<li>The added receipt will also be included in the sales report located in the left main menu under the reports section, to access the total collection by all members or any selected member.</li>\n</ol>", "is_active": 1, "order": 24}, {"question": "How to Create a Company?", "answer": "<p><strong>Create a Company Profile:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Log in to the CRM dashboard and find the company settings in the left main menu.</li>\n\t<li>Look for the option named \"Companies.\"</li>\n\t<li>Click on the \"+Add New\" button located in the top right corner.</li>\n\t<li>Fill in essential details such as the company name, address, contact information, tax details, and if you want to create invoices, fill the required fields of invoice settings.</li>\n\t<li>Save the company profile once all required fields are completed.</li>\n</ol>", "is_active": 1, "order": 25}, {"question": "How to generate API Key from Indiamart?", "answer": "<p>To Generate Api Key From indiamart.com</p>\n\n<p>Follow the instruction given by indiamart.com in the url given below.</p>\n\n<p><br>\n1.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://help.indiamart.com/knowledge-base/lms-crm-integration-v2/#Step-1:-Generate-CRM-Key\" target=\"_blank\">https://help.indiamart.com/knowledge-base/lms-crm-integration-v2/#Step-1:-Generate-CRM-Key</a></p>\n\n<p>2. If you faul to generate api key contact indiamart customer care.</p>", "is_active": 1, "order": 26}, {"question": "Step to Integrate Pharma Khabar Lead Manager API with ZigZapGo.", "answer": "<h3><strong>Step 1: Generate CRM Key</strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Visit <a href=\"https://www.pharmakhabar.com/\" target=\"_blank\">pharmakhabar.com</a>,&nbsp; Click log in button at right top corner.</li>\n\t<li>&nbsp;A pop up window will apperar, login with registered phone no with otp or log in with Email id and Password.</li>\n\t<li>When you log in sucessfull, your company name will starts appearing at right top corner and if it does not appers then check the your credentials.</li>\n\t<li>Click on the company name and a dropdown menu will apper.</li>\n\t<li>Click on personal home.</li>\n\t<li>Click on API/Notifications, and clcik on Re-Generate Api and hit submit.</li>\n\t<li>Copy the API Key and use.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Step 2: Add API&nbsp;Key In zigzapgo.com</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Visit </span><a href=\"https://zigzapgo.com\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">zigzapgo.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">,&nbsp; Click log in button at right top corner.</span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">&nbsp;A new window will apperar, login with registered phone no with otp or log in with Email id and Password.</span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">When you log in sucessfull, clcik on company setting on left menu.</span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Click on the Lead Api</span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Click on +Add New Botton on right top corner.</span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Select pharmakhabar from list and cleck Enable.</span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Enter the required values.</span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Click on submit button, now you will receive queries from pharmakhabar after 15 mins.</span></span></span></li>\n</ol>", "is_active": 1, "order": 27}, {"question": "Key Onboarding Steps for Whatsapp Business Api setup.", "answer": "<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Key Onboarding Steps</strong></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Easily create a WhatsApp Business account directly through your integration partner\'s website with our WhatsApp Business Platform onboarding process.</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Follow this checklist to quickly get started:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Facebook login</strong></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Login with a personal Facebook account. (Newly created accounts may not be approved.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\